\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Controlled KG swap and de-circularized evaluation. Left: hit@5 on the first split with the gold-aligned KG (aligned), the independent OpenIE KG (indep.), and BM25, and the paired hit@5 swap on the held-out split. Middle: answer accuracy of Qwen2.5-14B given each retriever's top five passages (alias-aware EM; judge accuracy on GraphRAG-Bench), with closed-book and gold-only accuracy. Right: paired per-question swap in answer accuracy, aligned minus independent, for both readers and splits; exact two-sided sign test, $^{*}p<0.05$, $^{**}p<0.01$ uncorrected; $^{\dagger }$significant after Holm correction over the $48$-cell grid.}}{7}{table.caption.15}\protected@file@percent }
