\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {19}{\ignorespaces KG swap with a BGE-M3 dense channel ([CLS] embedding). hit@5 of BM25, dense-only retrieval, and the two hybrid retrievers under the aligned and independent KG, with the paired swap difference and its $10{,}000$-resample bootstrap $95\%$ CI. BM25 and dense-only are identical across conditions. Every 2WikiMultiHop, MetaQA, and GraphRAG-Bench swap is significant by the exact sign test ($p<2\times 10^{-4}$). On STaRK-Prime the two held-out cells are significant ($p=0.039$ and $0.0034$), and the first-split hybrid cell is negative and not significant by the sign test ($p=0.070$), although its bootstrap CI excludes zero.}}{31}{table.caption.57}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:densebge}{{19}{31}{KG swap with a BGE-M3 dense channel ([CLS] embedding). hit@5 of BM25, dense-only retrieval, and the two hybrid retrievers under the aligned and independent KG, with the paired swap difference and its $10{,}000$-resample bootstrap $95\%$ CI. BM25 and dense-only are identical across conditions. Every 2WikiMultiHop, MetaQA, and GraphRAG-Bench swap is significant by the exact sign test ($p<2\times 10^{-4}$). On STaRK-Prime the two held-out cells are significant ($p=0.039$ and $0.0034$), and the first-split hybrid cell is negative and not significant by the sign test ($p=0.070$), although its bootstrap CI excludes zero}{table.caption.57}{}}
