\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {27}{\ignorespaces Larger readers on 2WikiMultiHop: Mistral-Small-24B and the proprietary Claude Sonnet~5.5. Paired swap, aligned minus independent KG, for every retriever and split: EM with each arm's EM (al., ind.), bootstrap $95\%$ CI, and exact sign-test $p$, and cover-EM (the gold answer stated in the reply's first line); $^{*}p<0.05$, $^{**}p<0.01$. Closed-book EM $0.050$/$0.055$ (Mistral) and $0.090$/$0.125$ (Claude), gold-only $0.555$/$0.620$ and $0.830$/$0.870$, BM25 passages $0.135$/$0.255$ and $0.450$/$0.485$ (first/held-out split). Both readers are run on 2WikiMultiHop only; Mistral-Small-24B is also the GraphRAG-Bench judge.}}{36}{table.caption.69}\protected@file@percent }
